  "notes": "订阅更新更可靠。\n\n- 订阅更新更可靠：优先经代理线路更新，主地址连不上时自动改用可信备用地址；服务器限流时提示需等待的时间，并在等待期间暂停重复请求；更新失败时说明具体原因（连接被干扰、超时、域名解析失败或网络不可达）。\n- 更换套餐前会明确提示将作废的剩余时长和流量，确认后才能下单，也可改为续费当前套餐。\n- 网络栈性能优化：每条连接占用的后台任务更少，连接较多时更轻快。\n- 问题修复：修复使用安全 DNS 检测账号接口时可用地址被误判为不可用；多处同时触发订阅更新时合并为一次请求。\n",
  "notesEn": "More reliable subscription updates.\n\n- More reliable subscription updates: updates now go through the proxy first and switch to a trusted alternative address when the primary one is unreachable. When the server rate-limits updates, the app shows how long to wait and pauses repeated requests meanwhile. Failed updates now state the cause (interfered connection, timeout, DNS failure or unreachable network).\n- Before you change plans, the app clearly shows the remaining time and data that will be forfeited and asks you to confirm; you can renew your current plan instead.\n- Network stack optimization: each connection runs fewer background tasks, keeping things lighter when many connections are open.\n- Bug fixes: secure-DNS checks no longer mark a working account address as unreachable, and simultaneous subscription update triggers are merged into one request.\n",
